<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Third-party notices</title>
<style>body{font-family:system-ui;max-width:52rem;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f6f6f6;padding:1rem;border-radius:6px}</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>This software bundles the following third-party components. Each is used unmodified;
its source is available from <a href="https://crates.io">crates.io</a> under the name and
version given, and from the repository linked where the crate declares one. Each license
text below is reproduced once per distinct text, with the crates it covers.</p>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by: {{#each used_by}}{{#if crate.repository}}<a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{else}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
